OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABoy critical after cardiac arrest
OL,4,Aat leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said
OL,7,Ftwo ambulances, a paramedic officer and
OL,8,Fthe Midlands Air Ambulance were
OL,9,Fdispatched to the scene where they
OL,10,Ffound a boy in a critical condition. He
OL,11,Fwas given specialist trauma care before
OL,12,Fbeing taken to Birmingham Children's
OL,13,FHospital.
OL,15,FStaffordshire Police said the boy
OL,16,Fremained in a critical but stable
OL,17,Fcondition in hospital. The force urged
OL,18,Fanyone with information to contact
OL,19,Fthem.
